# astrion-skill v1
goal: Decrease screen brightness one step
trigger:
  - phrase: "dimmer"
  - phrase: "brightness down"
  - phrase: "decrease brightness"
do: |
  Lower the display brightness by 10% via the system.setBrightness
  capability. If already at min (10%), show "Already at minimum
  brightness — won't go to zero." Otherwise show the new percentage.
constraints:
  level: L2
  budget_tokens: 100
  reversibility: FREE
